  "story": {
    "day": 87,
    "title": "Kaya's Shopping Adventure",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya went shopping at the big mall last Saturday.",
      "She wanted to visit a clothes place on the ninth floor.",
      "A blackboard showed the twentieth special item.",
      "Kaya liked a cap with a leopard print and a battle shirt.",
      "Her jeans were high on a shelf, between two skirts.",
      "The thirtieth dress was thirty dollars and fortieth cent.",
      "She tried on socks and a pretty shoe.",
      "\"I'd like this,\" she thought, \"but the ninetieth item looks bad.\"",
      "She decided to pay thirty dollars for her chosen skirt.",
      "After getting change, Kaya walked out to the street.",
      "The sixtieth shop had a story about a witch or religious design.",
      "A hundredth meter of fabric lay in a small yard.",
      "Kaya had no excuse; she would dance in them someday!",
      "The eightieth prize was for the thousandth visitor."
    ]
  }
